      { question: 'Can store owners check cameras on cell phones remotely?', answer: 'Yes, free remote mobile viewing on iOS and Android devices.' },
      { question: 'Do you offer zero monthly fee systems?', answer: 'Yes, 100% local NVR storage with zero monthly charges.' }
